  "_comment": "SAMPLE LinkedIn rubric for the demo world. Decision ORDER is fixed in code and is the safety mechanism: suppression -> hold -> CRM tier -> tier-1 -> job seeker -> spam -> default tier-2. This file supplies the LISTS only. Replace the lists with your own — `scripts/seed-profile.sh` installs a real one into the profile, which updates never overwrite. The JSON replaces code defaults wholesale, so EDIT lists, never delete keys.",
